              "locked": false,
              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Professional Groups and Committees welcome members who are passionate about developing nuclear medicine and supporting the wider professional community.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Opportunities to become involved include:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Contributing to professional guidelines.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Supporting education and training.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Developing conference programmes.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Participating in committee activities.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Supporting research and innovation.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Sharing specialist expertise.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Representing your professional discipline.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Whether you are early in your career or an experienced practitioner, there are many ways to contribute to the work of BNMS.</span></p><p></p>",
